      // C423 (07) / C506 (0B-0F, 12, 1A): JSR C1/C82D, an enemy attacker's arm C1/C8A8 -- no PC left -> C1/C72B; $B2AE's
      // $AEFF FF -> a PC at random (`LDA #03 / JSR C1/AF22` until present) into $B2AE / $AD8E, $AD8D = 1. Then $3A = 0
      // (07, C432) or 2 (the others, C511).
