// JMP C1/560C) and the per-segment path (C1/55FC -> BRA 1560C) land on `LDA #00 / JMP C1/75BB` = advance the
// script cursor by ZERO, so the same op is re-fetched every frame; only the stop probe takes C1/55FE
// (`STZ $A15B,X`) -> C1/5603 (`LDA $A4F0,X` = the op's own stored length) and lets the thread continue.
// The oracle shows the park directly: the role-0 cursor $5DBD freezes at CE/D4C6 for the whole walk and
// advances to CE/D4C8 exactly on the arrival frame (bat3 f50..f65 frozen, f66 advance).
// => everything below is measured RELATIVE TO ARRIVAL except the first three (which are relative to
// dispatch). Distances measured: 0 / 8 / 16 / 24 / 32 px of walk across 5 arenas.
