// ============ THE CRIT IS ARRIVAL-ANCHORED TOO (disasm/notes/battle_crit_timeline.md §5) ============
// The live per-role IP array $5DBD proves Crono's crit runs the bank-CE base script CE/03CC (role-0 track
// CE/03DC), NOT CD/6E4A: `1E 2B` (super -> CE/D795 = the LEAP block, `98 02 28`) | `03 31` (PLAY slash-1
// anim 0x31) | `36` | `03 32` (PLAY slash-2 anim 0x32) | `20 0A` | `1E 2A` (super -> CE/D776 = the SAME
// strike/RETURN block the normal attack uses: `98 02 19` home slide + `1B 19` snap). So the double slash is
