          // object; C1/7468: C1/65BA (unit steps $A880/$A882, |dx| $DE, |dy| $E0, $8C = the Y-dominant flag, $AAFE = the
          // dominant), nn >= the dominant distance -> $5D9E/$5D9F = 0, else $80/$82 += the steps nn times (an 8-bit `DEC $8E /
          // BNE`: nn = 0 runs 256) and $5D9E/$5D9F = the position + the high bytes. C1/7463 `LDA #03`: advance 3.
